**Class:** Colours | **Method:** withMultipliedBrightness

> An alternative hover technique to Colours.mix -- multiply brightness above 1.0 when hovered to brighten the colour in-place. Works well for saturated accent colours where mixing with white would desaturate.

```javascript
// Context: An alternative hover technique to Colours.mix -- multiply
