# Snapping a continuous value to discrete steps

**Class:** Math | **Method:** fmod

> Zoom handlers and grid-based controls need to quantize a continuous drag value to fixed increments. Subtracting the remainder from fmod rounds down to the nearest step.

```javascript
// Context: Zoom handlers and grid-based controls need to quantize
// a continuous drag value to fixed increments. Subtracting the
