**Class:** Message | **Method:** makeArtificial

> A polyphonic portamento script stores the artificial event ID per note number so each voice can be independently pitch-faded.

```javascript
// Context: A polyphonic portamento script stores the artificial event ID
// per note number so each voice can be independently pitch-faded.

reg noteIds = [];
noteIds.reserve(128);

for (i = 0; i < 128; i++)
    noteIds.push(-1);

reg lastPlayedNote = -1;

