# Constructing CC and pitch bend events for a MIDI sequence

**Class:** MessageHolder | **Method:** setControllerNumber

> A sequencer stores both note and controller data. CC events and pitch bend events are both created through the controller API, using virtual CC number 128 for pitch bend type coercion.

