# Fitting an icon path into a cell while preserving its aspect ratio

**Class:** Rectangle | **Method:** withAspectRatioLike

> When displaying vector icons from a path library in a grid layout, each cell is a fixed square but the icon paths have varying aspect ratios. withAspectRatioLike ensures the icon fills the cell without distortion.

```javascript
// Context: When displaying vector icons from a path library in a grid layout,
// each cell is a fixed square but the icon paths have varying aspect ratios.
// withAspectRatioLike ensures the icon fills the cell without distortion.

const var iconPanel = Content.addPanel("IconGrid", 0, 0);
iconPanel.set("width", 200);
iconPanel.set("height", 200);

const var icons = [];
for (i = 0; i < 4; i++)
{
    icons.push(Content.createPath());
    // ... load icon data
