# Velocity-Sensitive Drum Pad Mouse Callback

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/11556)

**Tags:** General Questions, trusted

Panel mouse callback that triggers MIDI notes via Synth.addNoteOn and Synth.addNoteOff for chord playback. Mouse Y position maps to velocity, providing velocity-sensitive drum pad behavior with proper note-off on mouse release.

```javascript
const var pad = Content.getComponent("DrumPad1");

pad.setMouseCallback(function(event)
{
	var ps = this.data.pitchSet;
	var l = ps.length;

	if (event.clicked)
	{
		var velocity = Math.round(event.y / this.getHeight() * 127);

