# Rounded Image Mask with Animation

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/10292)

**Tags:** General Questions, trusted

Panel paint routine using beginLayer, drawImage, applyMask, and endLayer to clip an image to a rounded rectangle shape. Includes a timer callback that animates the corner radius using Math.sin for a pulsing mask effect.

```javascript
Engine.loadAudioFilesIntoPool();
const var mask = Content.createPath();
const var Panel1 = Content.getComponent("Panel1");
