# Slider Snap with Interpolation

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/7690)

**Tags:** General Questions, author

Value snapping logic that supports both strict snap-to-array-values mode and smooth interpolation between array entries. Uses Math.floor and Math.fmod to calculate the fractional position and linearly interpolate between adjacent snap points.

```javascript
const var v = [100, 200, 400, 800, 1600, 3200];

inline function getSnappedFrequency(value, snapEnabled)
{
	local idx = parseInt(Math.floor(value));

	if (snapEnabled)
		return v[idx];

	local lo = v[idx];
	local hi = v[idx + 1];
	local alpha = Math.fmod(value, 1.0);
	return lo * (1.0 - alpha) + hi * alpha;
}
```

