# Multi-Output Routing Matrix Switch

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/1845)

**Tags:** General Questions, expert

Synth.getChildSynth with getRoutingMatrix and addConnection to switch audio output channels via a combo box. Routes stereo pairs to different output buses and falls back to channels 1-2 on error.

```javascript
const var MasterChain = Synth.getChildSynth("master");
const var matrix = MasterChain.getRoutingMatrix();

const var cmbOutput = [
                          Content.getComponent("cmbOutput0"),
                          Content.getComponent("cmbOutput1")
                      ];

for (c in cmbOutput)
	c.setControlCallback(changeOutput);

inline function changeOutput(component, value)
{
	local success = true;
	local idx = cmbOutput.indexOf(component);

	if (value == 1)
	{
		matrix.addConnection(0 + (idx * 2), 0);
		matrix.addConnection(1 + (idx * 2), 1);
	}

	else if (value == 2)
	{
		matrix.addConnection(0 + (idx * 2), 2);
		success = matrix.addConnection(1 + (idx * 2), 3);
	}

	else if (value == 3)
	{
		matrix.addConnection(0 + (idx * 2), 4);
		success = matrix.addConnection(1 + (idx * 2), 5);
	}

	if (!success)
	{
		matrix.addConnection(0 + (idx * 2), 0);
		matrix.addConnection(1 + (idx * 2), 1);
	}
}
```

