Engine.createTransportHandler with setOnBeatChange, setOnTransportChange, and setSyncMode to handle DAW transport synchronization. Switches between PreferExternal and SyncInternal modes based on playback state, with stopInternalClockOnExternalStop(false) to keep the internal clock running when the DAW stops. Includes startInternalClock/stopInternalClock button control.

```javascript
Content.makeFrontInterface(200, 300);

