# Animated Rotating Triangle on Click

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/7335)

**Tags:** Scripting, trusted

Panel setMouseCallback with setTimerCallback to animate a triangle rotation on click. Toggles between 0 and 90 degrees with incremental angle steps in the timer, using g.rotate and g.fillTriangle in the paint routine.

```javascript
Content.makeFrontInterface(600, 600);
Console.clear();


const var panel = Content.getComponent("panel");
panel.data.angle = 0;
panel.data.state = false;


