# Wet/Dry Level Monitor with Timer

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/3272)

**Tags:** Scripting, trusted

Engine.createTimerObject polling getCurrentLevel on both a ConvolutionReverb and an Empty effect module to display separate wet and dry signal levels. Converts gain factors to decibels with Engine.getDecibelsForGainFactor and updates knob displays.

```javascript
Content.makeFrontInterface(600, 500);

const var ConvolutionReverb1 = Synth.getEffect("Convolution Reverb1");
const var Empty1 = Synth.getEffect("Empty1");

