Content.createLocalLookAndFeel with all FlexAHDSR LAF functions: drawFlexAhdsrBackground, drawFlexAhdsrFullPath, drawFlexAhdsrCurvePoint, drawFlexAhdsrSegment, and drawFlexAhdsrPosition. Includes Engine.createBroadcaster with attachToComplexData to synchronize the draggable AHDSR display with scripting UI knobs.

```javascript
Content.makeFrontInterface(600, 400);

namespace FlexAHDSRHandler
{


const var laf = Content.createLocalLookAndFeel();

// These are all LAF function available for the flex envelope
laf.registerFunction("drawFlexAhdsrBackground", function(g, obj)
{
	g.fillAll(0xFF222222);
});

laf.registerFunction("drawFlexAhdsrFullPath", function(g, obj)
{
