# Keyboard Range from Knobs

**Source:** [Forum Topic](https://forum.hise.audio/topic/7248)

**Tags:** General Questions, expert, solved

Two knobs controlling the LowKey and HiKey of a Keyboard FloatingTile via get("Data").parseAsJSON() and set("Data", trace(data)). Shared setKeyboardRange function updates both properties simultaneously.

```javascript
Content.makeFrontInterface(600, 600);

const var fltKeyboard = Content.getComponent("fltKeyboard");

const var knbLow = Content.getComponent("knbLow");
knbLow.setControlCallback(onknbLowControl);

inline function onknbLowControl(component, value)
{
	setKeyboardRange(knbLow.getValue(), knbHigh.getValue());
}

const var knbHigh = Content.getComponent("knbHigh");
knbHigh.setControlCallback(onknbHighControl);

inline function onknbHighControl(component, value)
{
	setKeyboardRange(knbLow.getValue(), knbHigh.getValue());
}

inline function setKeyboardRange(low, high)
{
	local data = fltKeyboard.get("Data").parseAsJSON();

	data.LowKey = low;
	data.HiKey = high;

	fltKeyboard.set("Data", trace(data));
}
```
